 [1mContext[22m[K[147C
[155C
 When a user resumes a session (chat history → send to → CLI), the terminal tab currently starts in "Connected" state like a normal session. This is wrong 
  — the resumed session immediately begins working (injecting the summary prompt into the LLM), so the tab should show "Thinking" from the start. Normal   
 (non-resumed) sessions are unaffected.[116C
[155C
