 [1mWhy[22m [1mthis[22m [1mworks[22m[K[140C
[155C
 - [38;2;177;185;249m_transitionTo(THINKING) [mautomatically sets [38;2;177;185;249m_awaitingFirstIdle = true[K[84C[m
 - Existing [38;2;177;185;249monSessionIdle() [mchecks [38;2;177;185;249m_awaitingFirstIdle [mand transitions to READY[K[77C
 - After READY, normal Enter → THINKING → idle → READY cycle continues unchanged[75C
 - Flag is consumed (reset to [38;2;177;185;249mfalse[m) on socket open, so reconnects behave normally[K[73C
 - Normal sessions never set the flag, so their flow is unchanged[90C
[155C
 [1mVerification[22m[K[142C
[155C
 1. Start a normal session — should show "Connected" on socket open, then "Thinking" on Enter, then "Ready" on first idle[34C
 2. Resume a session from chat history — should show "Thinking" immediately on socket open (with emoji animation + progress bar), then "Ready" on first    
 idle[150C
 3. After "Ready" in a resumed session, press Enter — should cycle to "Thinking" then "Ready" as normal[52C
