     [1m[4m[3mResumed Session: Start in Thinking State[22m[24m[23m[K[110C
[155C
     [1mContext[22m[K[143C
[155C
     When a user resumes a session (chat history → send to → CLI), the terminal tab currently starts in "Connected" state like a normal session. This is   
     wrong — the resumed session immediately begins working (injecting the summary prompt into the LLM), so the tab should show "Thinking" from the start. 
     Normal (non-resumed) sessions are unaffected.[105C
[155C
     [1mChanges[22m [1m(2[22m [1mfiles,[22m [1m~8[22m [1mlines)[22m[K[123C
[155C
     [1m1.[22m [38;2;177;185;249m[1mVibeRails/wwwroot/js/modules/terminal-tab-status.js[m[K[96C
[155C
     [1mA.[22m [1mConstructor[22m [1m(line[22m [1m64[22m [1marea)[22m — add field:[K[108C
     [36mthis[m._startAsThinking = [34mfalse[m;[K[120C
[155C
     [1mB.[22m [1mNew[22m [1mmethod[22m [1m(after[22m [38;2;177;185;249m[1monSocketOpen[m[1m,[22m [1m~line[22m [1m147)[22m:[K[104C
     [33mmarkResumedSession() [m{[K[128C
[36m[9Cthis[m._startAsThinking = [34mtrue[m;[K[117C
     }[149C
[155C
     [1mC.[22m [1mModify[22m [38;2;177;185;249m[1monSocketOpen() [m[1m(lines[22m [1m145-147)[22m — skip CONNECTED for resumed sessions:[K[71C
     [33monSocketOpen() [m{[K[134C
[34m[9Cif [m([36mthis[m._startAsThinking) {[K[118C
[36m[13Cthis[m._startAsThinking = [34mfalse[m;[K[112C
[36m[13Cthis[m._transitionTo(TAB_STATUS.THINKING);[K[102C
         } [34melse [m{[K[138C
[36m[13Cthis[m._transitionTo(TAB_STATUS.CONNECTED);[K[101C
         }[145C
     }[149C
[155C
     [1m2.[22m [38;2;177;185;249m[1mVibeRails/wwwroot/js/modules/terminal-multitab.js[m[K[98C
[155C
     [1mIn[22m [38;2;177;185;249m[1mstartSession(body) [m[1m(~line[22m [1m626,[22m [1mbefore[22m [38;2;177;185;249m[1mawait[m [38;2;177;185;249m[1mthis.connect()[m[1m):[22m[K[87C
     [34mif [m(body.resumeSessionId) {[K[123C
[36m[9Cthis[m.statusController?.markResumedSession();[K[102C
     }[149C
[155C
     [1mWhy[22m [1mthis[22m [1mworks[22m[K[136C
[155C
     - [38;2;177;185;249m_transitionTo(THINKING) [mautomatically sets [38;2;177;185;249m_awaitingFirstIdle = true[K[80C[m
     - Existing [38;2;177;185;249monSessionIdle() [mchecks [38;2;177;185;249m_awaitingFirstIdle [mand transitions to READY[K[73C
     - After READY, normal Enter → THINKING → idle → READY cycle continues unchanged[71C
     - Flag is consumed (reset to [38;2;177;185;249mfalse[m) on socket open, so reconnects behave normally[K[69C
     - Normal sessions never set the flag, so their flow is unchanged[86C
[155C
     [1mVerification[22m[K[138C
[155C
     1. Start a normal session — should show "Connected" on socket open, then "Thinking" on Enter, then "Ready" on first idle[30C
     2. Resume a session from chat history — should show "Thinking" immediately on socket open (with emoji animation + progress bar), then "Ready" on first
      idle[145C
     3. After "Ready" in a resumed session, press Enter — should cycle to "Thinking" then "Ready" as normal[48C
[155C
[38;2;255;255;255m● [mMaking the changes now.[K[130C
