     [1mWhy[22m [1mthis[22m [1mworks[22m[K[136C
[155C
     - [38;2;177;185;249m_transitionTo(THINKING) [mautomatically sets [38;2;177;185;249m_awaitingFirstIdle = true[K[80C[m
     - Existing [38;2;177;185;249monSessionIdle() [mchecks [38;2;177;185;249m_awaitingFirstIdle [mand transitions to READY[K[73C
     - After READY, normal Enter → THINKING → idle → READY cycle continues unchanged[71C
     - Flag is consumed (reset to [38;2;177;185;249mfalse[m) on socket open, so reconnects behave normally[K[69C
     - Normal sessions never set the flag, so their flow is unchanged[86C
[155C
     [1mVerification[22m[K[138C
[155C
     1. Start a normal session — should show "Connected" on socket open, then "Thinking" on Enter, then "Ready" on first idle[30C
     2. Resume a session from chat history — should show "Thinking" immediately on socket open (with emoji animation + progress bar), then "Ready" on first
      idle[145C
     3. After "Ready" in a resumed session, press Enter — should cycle to "Thinking" then "Ready" as normal[48C
[155C
