     [1m[4m[3mResumed Session: Start in Thinking State[22m[24m[23m[K[127C
[172C
     [1mContext[22m[K[160C
[172C
     When a user resumes a session (chat history → send to → CLI), the terminal tab currently starts in "Connected" state like a normal session. This is wrong —[12C
      the resumed session immediately begins working (injecting the summary prompt into the LLM), so the tab should show "Thinking" from the start. Normal[18C
