     [1m[4m[3mResumed Session: Start in Thinking State[22m[24m[23m[K[137C
[182C
     [1mContext[22m[K[170C
[182C
     When a user resumes a session (chat history → send to → CLI), the terminal tab currently starts in "Connected" state like a normal session. This is wrong —[22C
      the resumed session immediately begins working (injecting the summary prompt into the LLM), so the tab should show "Thinking" from the start. Normal[28C
     (non-resumed) sessions are unaffected.[139C
[182C
